{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20181","headline":"子庆诗 · 孟郊","name":"子庆诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王家事已奇，孟氏庆无涯。\n献子还生子，羲之又有之。\n凤兮且莫叹，鲤也会闻诗。\n小小豫章甲，纤纤玉树姿。\n人来唯仰乳，母抱未知慈。\n我欲拣其养，放麛者是谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}